SUMMARY:Deadline: Campus Cultura: paid artistic research places on transiti
 ons in the Zeeland Delta (EUR 19\,000 per place\, eight places 2027-2028)
DESCRIPTION:Campus Cultura creates eight paid artistic research places betw
 een January 2027 and September 2028 for artists who want to investigate tr
 ansitions in the Zeeland Delta\, around land\, water\, food and living tog
 ether. WHO: artists of all disciplines\, alone or as a collective\, with a
 t least two years of their own artistic practice. Dutch is the working lan
 guage.\n\nOrganisation: Lectoraat Kunst | Cultuur | Transitie (HZ Universi
 ty of Applied Sciences)\, with Delta Climate Center\, CBK Zeeland and ArtB
 ase Terneuzen\; funded by the Regio Deal Cultuur\, Province of Zeeland\nLo
 cation: Zeeland\, Netherlands. Dutch is the working language. Five places 
 are for artists working in Zeeland\, three for artists working elsewhere.\
 nAward: EUR 19\,000 including VAT per research place\, for fee and materia
 l costs. Eight places between January 2027 and September 2028. No applicat
 ion fee stated.\nDuration: At least 6 months per research period\n\nMore: 
 https://www.kennismanagementsysteem.nl/wiki/index.php/Campus_Cultura?utm_s
 ource=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.kennismanagementsysteem.nl/wiki/index.php/Campus_Cultura?ut
 m_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Zeeland\, Netherlands. Dutch is the working language. Five places 
 are for artists working in Zeeland\, three for artists working elsewhere.
END:VEVENT
